# hw1 expectations (Fomu color-cycling demo).
# The LED cycles through 8 color values (0-7) with a visible delay
# between each step.  The program never terminates; these records
# check the init marker and the first few color transitions.

# --- init: $F000 = $A5, $F001 = $01 (red) ---
M F000 A5
M F001 01
F I 1

# --- main loop: $01 → $02 (green) ---
M F001 02

# --- $02 → $03 (yellow) ---
M F001 03

# --- $03 → $04 (blue) ---
M F001 04

# --- $04 → $05 (magenta) ---
M F001 05

# --- $05 → $06 (cyan) ---
M F001 06

# --- $06 → $07 (white) ---
M F001 07

# --- $07 → $00 (off) ---
M F001 00

# --- $00 → $01 (red again) ---
M F001 01